CONTENT vs CODE
---------------

The source CODE in this repository is AGPL-3.0 (this file).

The CONTENT published on the platform — climate solutions, crisis reports,
articles, images — is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. See CONTENT_LICENSE.md.

Two layers, both open. Code is AGPL, content is Creative Commons.